{"id":"e309a228bb19c798","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-simple-module.md","title":"Simple Module","display":"df-simple-module — Simple Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-simple-module","aliases":["58-df-simple-module","Simple Module","Irreducible Module"],"display":"df-simple-module — Simple Module","depends_on":["[[58-df-module]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-simple-module"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-simple-module</span><span>Simple Module</span><span>Irreducible Module</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-module — Simple Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\((R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> (ring structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,+_M,0_M,\\odot)\">\\((M,+_M,0_M,\\odot)\\)</span> (left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-module structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\)</span> (structured module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash \\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x-y\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(r\\odot x\\in N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash \\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x-y\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(r\\odot x\\in N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land M\\neq\\{0_M\\}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\to(N=\\{0_M\\}\\lor N=M)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land M\\neq\\{0_M\\}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\to(N=\\{0_M\\}\\lor N=M)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A simple module is nonzero and has no proper nonzero submodule.</li>\n<li>Schur's lemma is a theorem about homomorphisms between simple modules, not a predicate defining the ring.</li>\n<li>Composition series, Jordan-Holder, and semisimplicity require separate atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lam, A First Course in Noncommutative Rings</li>\n<li>Assem, Simson and Skowronski, Elements of the Representation Theory of Associative Algebras</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)$ (structured module predicate, see [[58-df-module]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"(M,+_M,0_M,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash \\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(x-y\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(r\\odot x\\in N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land M\\neq\\{0_M\\}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\to(N=\\{0_M\\}\\lor N=M)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"153f6e55df144344","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md]])"},{"id":"ab95f9ceb47742ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S$ and $\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S$ (see [[58-df-simple-module]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md|58-df-simple-module]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373"]}